      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GOCCIADORO (5) was a beaten favourite first up but he drew on the back row when tackling older rivals and should be better for it. Showed ability last campaign, winning a Nutrien heat here three back and earlier placing in the Gold Crown. He draws well and is suited back against his own age group. STRAATHDALE (6) must be considered having kicked off his career with an easy win here before chasing a handy one as runner-up last start. Has upside. TEDDY LOU (4) is first up for four months but looked good in winning his two outings of his maiden prep, both coming at this circuit and distance. Draws well and has been readied with two trials, winning the latest. BOYSTROUS (7) was midfield from the back line last time but has won three of the four times he has started on this row.",
